<title>USA: Duke shuts McGuire 1 nuke as scheduled.</title>
<headline>Duke shuts McGuire 1 nuke as scheduled.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Power Co has shut its 1,129 megawatt (MW) McGuire 1 nuclear power unit as planned for a 13-week refueling outage, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission said Friday in its plant status report.</p>
<p>The unit, in Cornelius, N.C., was taken off line to replace a steam generator.</p>
<p>The adjacent unit 2, with an identical generating capacity, is operating at full power.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
</text>
